      '\n' +
      'Read **PRODUCT_DIRECTION.md** for the affordable product sequence, including validated valuation, proposed DCA/signal rules and the path from paper testing to a later customer product. These proposed features are not advertised as implemented. Read **verification/PRODUCT_REVIEW_REPORT.md** for current results and limitations.\n' +
      '\n' +
      '## Local application\n' +
